- `WiFiClient wifi;` `PubSubClient mqtt(wifi);` and the broker address `IPAddress broker(192, 168, 1, 10);`;
- setup(): `WiFi.begin("Atelier", "jollof2024");`, wait for `WL_CONNECTED`, then `mqtt.setServer(broker, 1883);` and `mqtt.setCallback(recu);`;
- loop(): if `!mqtt.connected()`, `mqtt.connect("esp32-atelier")` then `mqtt.subscribe("atelier/led");`; `mqtt.loop();`; every 2 s, `mqtt.publish("atelier/pot", …)` with `analogRead(32)`;
- the `recu(topic, message, length)` function lights the LED if the message starts with 1.
